            "path": "Section 4.1 Structure of the QR code"
          }
        ],
        "note": "Enforcement dates: the table prints \"from 4th December 2021\" against tags 1-5 and \"from 1st January 2023\" against tags 6-9; the row alignment in the PDF is loose, so the split at tag 5/6 follows the phase definitions. A Phase 1 receipt needs tags 1-5 only. Amount formatting (decimal places) in tags 4 and 5 is not specified in this section. In practice many implementations put the Base64 text of the hash in tag 6 rather than 32 raw bytes; test against the ZATCA SDK before shipping Phase 2 output."
